  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large bowl, combine miso paste, sesame dressing, the honey and a squeeze of lemon juice. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f859c10d0527cba53b128e/step-bd960b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small heatproof bowl, combine garlic, the low sodium soy sauce, brown sugar and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• In a large frying pan, heat olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people) over high heat, until just smoking, 30 seconds - 1 minute, then carefully pour the oil over the garlic mixture. Set aside.\n• TIP: The hot oil will bubble up and ‘cook’ the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f859c10d0527cba53b128e/step-bfe73e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, add vegetable gyozas, flat-side down, in a single layer.\n• Cook until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (watch out, it may spatter!) and cover with a lid (or foil).\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyozas are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f859c10d0527cba53b128e/step-1c5e8420.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the bowl with miso dressing, add deluxe salad mix, mixed salad leaves and cucumber, tossing to coat. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• Divide sesame-miso salad between bowls. Top with veggie potstickers.\n• Garnish with crispy shallots. Serve with garlic chilli oil and remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f859c10d0527cba53b128e/step-bc270230.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
